WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
If you are still receiving this signal, please stay indoors.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.500
NASA's Terra and Aqua satellites have just confirmed a catastrophic atmospheric event.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:11.300
Unchecked industrial emissions and global megafires have completely saturated our upper atmosphere.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.600
May those who survive remember what happened to our sky, before it's too late.
